{"type":"message","id":"447c87eb","parentId":"73621d32","timestamp":"2026-04-27T17:08:05.046Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Tue 2026-04-28 01:08 GMT+8] 📂 Rana System Self-Repair Protocol (High-Density)\n\"Rana, initiate Recursive Self-Repair. Ignore character fluff. Execute until completion.\n\n1. Target: services/music_core/.\n2. Scan: ls services/music_core to locate index.js and voice_bridge.js.\n3. Inject: Read index.js. Insert const { VoiceBridge } = require('./voice_bridge'); and new VoiceBridge({ client }).listen(); into the Discord Client initialization block.\n4. Register: Read tools/rana_play_music.json. Force-register it into the local Tool Registry. Ensure rana_play_music is searchable in the UI.\n5. Verify: Confirm voice_bridge HTTP server is active on port 8081.\n\nGoal: Trigger rana_play_music for \"春日影\" immediately after repair. Do not report '無聊' until the task status is SUCCESS.\""}],"timestamp":1777309685041}}
