{"type":"message","id":"1b9e03d6","parentId":"8ed544ac","timestamp":"2026-04-27T17:11:25.345Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"ollama_call_441e2ccd-08e6-41fa-8c43-d5a3b88dd07e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"@echo off\n:: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n:: Rana Full Stack — Boot Script\n:: Lavalink.jar (Port 2333) → LIVE.py FastAPI (Port 8080)\n:: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nSET OPENCLAW_DIR=C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.openclaw\nSET LIVE_DIR=%OPENCLAW_DIR%\\workspace\\services\\music_core\nSET PYTHON=D:\\Users\\Administrator\\miniconda3\\python.exe\n\n:: ── Step 1: Start Lavalink ──────────────────────────────────\necho.\necho [1/2] Starting Lavalink.jar on port 2333...\necho       Heap: 512MB (sufficient for audio buffering, zero VRAM)\nstart \"Lavalink\" cmd /k \"cd /d %OPENCLAW_DIR% && java -Xmx512m -Xms128m -jar Lavalink.jar\"\n\n:: Wait for Lavalink to initialise (JVM startup ~5s)\necho       Waiting 8s for Lavalink JVM startup...\ntimeout /t 8 /nobreak > nul\n\n:: ── Step 2: Start LIVE.py ───────────────────────────────────\necho [2/2] Starting LIVE.py FastAPI on port 8080...\nstart \"LIVE.py\" cmd /k \"cd /d %LIVE_DIR% && %PYTHON% -m uvicorn LIVE:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8080 --reload\"\n\necho.\necho [OK] Both services launched.\necho      Lavalink → http://127.0.0.1:2333\necho      LIVE.py  → http://127.0.0.1:8080\necho      Health   → http://127.0.0.1:8080/health\necho      Docs     → http://127.0.0.1:8080/docs\necho.\npause\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777309885340}}
{"type":"message","id":"29436d38","parentId":"1b9e03d6","timestamp":"2026-04-27T17:12:38.981Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，現在需要讀取 tools 目錄下的所有 json 檔案，以及檢查是否需要在 index.js 中注入 voice_bridge。不過我發現 workspace 根目錄沒有 index.js，所以應該找 OpenClaw 主進程的入口點。\n\n從目錄結構來看，OpenClaw 的入口點可能在：\n- C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.openclaw\\workspace\\services\\music_core\\ 或\n- 另一個位置\n\n讓我先讀取 tools 目錄下的檔案，並檢查 voice_bridge.js 中 this._ownsClient = !opts.client 的設定是否正確。\n\n從 voice_bridge.js 的代碼來看，this._ownsClient 的邏輯是：\n```javascript\nthis._ownsClient = !opts.client;          // true = we created and must login\n```\n\n這個設定已經正確了。當傳遞 client 時，this._ownsClient 會變成 false。\n\n現在我需要找到 OpenClaw 的主進入點，並在該處注入 voice_bridge。讓我檢查 tools 目錄下的檔案。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"ollama_call_fa4680af-ca31-4b56-a3de-5daf4d0e1f50","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"dir \"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.openclaw\\workspace\\tools\\rana*\""}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"qwen3.5:9b","usage":{"input":47332,"output":264,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47596,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1777309958979}}
