{"type":"message","id":"93fb4858","parentId":"e0b12393","timestamp":"2026-04-27T17:21:52.794Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Tue 2026-04-28 01:21 GMT+8] \"Rana, initiate 'Task-Until-Success' recursive loop. Target: Play '春日影' in Discord VC. Do NOT report '無聊' or terminate until playback is confirmed.\"\n\nCondition Checklist & Auto-Fix Steps:\n\nClient Identity Check: Find the master script (e.g., services/music_core/index.js or root) that calls new Client().\n\nDouble-Login Fix (4014 Prevention): Read services/music_core/voice_bridge.js. Delete any client.login() calls.\n\nThe Hook Surgery: Inject const { VoiceBridge } = require('./voice_bridge'); and new VoiceBridge({ client }).listen(); into the master script's Client initialization block.\n\nTool Activation: Read tools/rana_play_music.json. Force-register it into your active Tool Registry so it is no longer 'No Results' in the UI.\n\nFinal Execution: Once repaired, trigger rana_play_music for '春日影'.\n\nFailure Protocol: If any step fails (ENOENT, 4014 error, etc.), you must automatically search subdirectories (e.g., services/music_core/) and retry with corrected logic until the audio starts playing.\n\nVerification: Report 'Success: Music Playing' only when the Lavalink session confirms the TrackStartEvent."}],"timestamp":1777310512791}}
{"type":"message","id":"c09526a6","parentId":"93fb4858","timestamp":"2026-04-27T17:23:26.567Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用戶讓我執行一個複雜的任務，需要我：\n1. 找到主腳本（呼叫 new Client() 的檔案）\n2. 檢查 voice_bridge.js 是否有 client.login() 並刪除\n3. 在 master script 中注入 VoiceBridge\n4. 註冊 rana_play_music 工具\n5. 播放春日影\n\n從之前讀取的內容來看：\n- voice_bridge.js 已經有 v2.0 的代碼，並且 _ownsClient 已設為 false 當傳入 client 時\n- 但 rana_play_music.json 已經存在於 tools/\n- 我需要找到 master script（主進入點）\n\n從之前的目錄列表來看，我沒有看到 index.js。從 start_live.bat 可以看到 LIVE.py 是用 FastAPI 啟動的。\n\n讓我先搜索包含 \"new Client\" 的檔案。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"ollama_call_18bd4379-6524-4281-a567-0cdf4d68601f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Get-ChildItem -Recurse -Path \"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.openclaw\\workspace\" -Include *.js -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-String -Pattern \"new Client\" -CaseSensitive:$false","env":{"OCLAW_EXEC_DISABLE_AUTO_EXIT":"true"}}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"qwen3.5:9b","usage":{"input":51199,"output":283,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51482,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1777310606567}}
