{"type":"message","id":"10f8ea09","parentId":"21bacf22","timestamp":"2026-04-27T17:23:49.914Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"ollama_call_93d0286e-683d-48d8-9805-f42672430cd8","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.openclaw\\workspace\\services\\music_core\\voice_bridge.js","limit":20}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"qwen3.5:9b","usage":{"input":51888,"output":56,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51944,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1777310629913}}
{"type":"message","id":"a65b17d8","parentId":"10f8ea09","timestamp":"2026-04-27T17:23:49.962Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"ollama_call_93d0286e-683d-48d8-9805-f42672430cd8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/**\n * voice_bridge.js — Rana Voice Gateway Bridge v2.0\n * =================================================\n * FIX: Raw Gateway Forwarding — eliminates the competing-Client conflict.\n *\n * ── ROOT CAUSE (v1) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n *   voice_bridge.js spawned its own discord.js Client with the same bot token\n *   as OpenClaw. Both Clients received the same gateway packets. The sequence:\n *\n *     voice_bridge OP4 join\n *       → Discord dispatches VOICE_STATE_UPDATE + VOICE_SERVER_UPDATE to BOTH shards\n *       → OpenClaw's discord.js internal voice.adapters fires cleanup\n *       → cleanup emits OP4 disconnect on OpenClaw's shard\n *       → Lavalink's voice UDP is invalidated → WebSocketClosedEvent (4014 / 4006)\n *       → playback dies immediately after TrackStartEvent\n *\n *   Secondary bugs in v1:\n *     • `channelId` included in the Lavalink v4 `voice` body (invalid field → silent ignore or reject)\n *     • Pre-join disconnect always fired, even when bot was already in the correct channel,\n *       creating a spurious VOICE_STATE_UPDATE(channel_id: null) that raced Lavalink's handshake.\n\n[634 more lines in file. Use offset=21 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777310629957}}
