{"type":"message","id":"d6901cd2","parentId":"e6b643c8","timestamp":"2026-04-27T17:34:13.016Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我需要讀取 voice_bridge.js 的完整內容來找到 client.login() 的行，然後移除它。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"ollama_call_9412531f-57f8-4a5e-b685-60bf2012198c","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.openclaw\\workspace\\services\\music_core\\voice_bridge.js","edits":[{"newText":"      this._hookGateway();\n      log('DISCORD', `Attached to OpenClaw client (${this.client.user.tag}) — no second login`).client = this.client;\n    } else {","oldText":"      this._hookGateway();\n      await new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n        this.client.once('ready', resolve);\n        this.client.once('error', reject);\n        this.client.login(BOT_TOKEN).catch(reject);\n      });\n\n      log('DISCORD', `Logged in as ${this.client.user.tag} (standalone mode)`);\n      log('DISCORD', `Guilds: ${this.client.guilds.cache.map(g => `${g.name}(${g.id})`).join(', ')}`);\n    } else {"}]}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"qwen3.5:9b","usage":{"input":67613,"output":255,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67868,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1777311253016}}
{"type":"message","id":"cccce317","parentId":"d6901cd2","timestamp":"2026-04-27T17:34:13.138Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"ollama_call_9412531f-57f8-4a5e-b685-60bf2012198c","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"tool\": \"edit\",\n  \"error\": \"Could not find the exact text in C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\services\\\\music_core\\\\voice_bridge.js. The old text must match exactly including all whitespace and newlines.\\nCurrent file contents:\\n/**\\n * voice_bridge.js — Rana Voice Gateway Bridge v2.0\\n * =================================================\\n * FIX: Raw Gateway Forwarding — eliminates the competing-Client conflict.\\n *\\n * ── ROOT CAUSE (v1) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n *   voice_bridge.js spawned its own discord.js Client with the same bot token\\n *   as OpenClaw. Both Clients received the same gateway packets. The sequence:\\n *\\n *     voice_bridge OP4 join\\n *       → Discord dispatches VOICE_STATE_UPDATE + VOICE_SERVER_UPDATE to BOTH shards\\n *       → OpenClaw's discord.js internal voice.adapters fires cleanup\\n *       → cleanup emits OP4 disconnect on OpenClaw's shard\\n *       → Lavalink's voice UDP is invalidated → WebSocketClosedEvent (4014 / 4006)\\n *       → playback dies immediately aft\\n... (truncated)\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"error","tool":"edit","error":"Could not find the exact text in C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.openclaw\\workspace\\services\\music_core\\voice_bridge.js. The old text must match exactly including all whitespace and newlines.\nCurrent file contents:\n/**\n * voice_bridge.js — Rana Voice Gateway Bridge v2.0\n * =================================================\n * FIX: Raw Gateway Forwarding — eliminates the competing-Client conflict.\n *\n * ── ROOT CAUSE (v1) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n *   voice_bridge.js spawned its own discord.js Client with the same bot token\n *   as OpenClaw. Both Clients received the same gateway packets. The sequence:\n *\n *     voice_bridge OP4 join\n *       → Discord dispatches VOICE_STATE_UPDATE + VOICE_SERVER_UPDATE to BOTH shards\n *       → OpenClaw's discord.js internal voice.adapters fires cleanup\n *       → cleanup emits OP4 disconnect on OpenClaw's shard\n *       → Lavalink's voice UDP is invalidated → WebSocketClosedEvent (4014 / 4006)\n *       → playback dies immediately aft\n... (truncated)"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777311253133}}
