{"type":"message","id":"f88646d2","parentId":"cab64227","timestamp":"2026-05-05T09:59:44.360Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用戶要我播放 YouTube 連結。我有 rana_play_music 工具，但需要先檢查它是否能被調用。讓我嘗試呼叫這個工具。\n\n不過我需要注意 HEARTBEAT.md 的規定：\n- 演奏(rana_play_music)可以接受，但要有抹茶\n- 完全沒人說話且沒有有趣的事 → 才輸出 HEARTBEAT_OK\n\n現在用戶在要求播放音樂，這是有興趣的事，所以不應該直接輸出 HEARTBEAT_OK。\n\n讓我呼叫 rana_play_music 工具來播放這個 YouTube 連結。但我需要先找到正確的調用方式。工具定義在 tools/rana_play_music.json 中。\n\n我需要提供 url, guild_id, channel_id 這些參數。但用戶只提供了 URL。我需要詢問 guild_id 和 channel_id，或者如果這是在語音頻道的上下文中，可能這些資訊會從其他地方取得。\n\n不過讓我先嘗試呼叫這個工具，看看會發生什麼。但問題是我不知道正確的頻道 ID。用戶沒有提供。\n\n我應該先詢問用戶語音頻道的 ID，因為這是需要的參數。或者，如果系統知道語音頻道的上下文，我可以直接呼叫工具。\n\n讓我再想想... 用戶說「播放」這個連結，可能暗示他們已經在語音頻道中了。我需要 guild_id 和 channel_id 來呼叫 rana_play_music。\n\n我應該詢問用戶這些資訊，或者如果這是 OpenClaw 本身的工具，可能它們會自動知道上下文。\n\n讓我先讀取 rana_play_music.json 來看看工具定義。"},{"type":"text","text":"抹茶。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"ollama_call_b3e0a344-4cde-482a-9c1b-9626a1e62c56","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.openclaw\\workspace\\tools\\rana_play_music.json"}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"qwen3.5:9b","usage":{"input":86938,"output":372,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87310,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1777975184360}}
{"type":"message","id":"5009c8d5","parentId":"f88646d2","timestamp":"2026-05-05T09:59:44.436Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"ollama_call_b3e0a344-4cde-482a-9c1b-9626a1e62c56","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"rana_play_music\",\n  \"description\": \"Play audio from a media URL in the user's Discord voice channel. Supports YouTube, Bilibili (B站), Threads, Instagram Reels, and Facebook Video. Call this when the user shares a URL or asks Rana to play a song. After a successful 'queued' response, generate a Rana-style in-character reply using the 'title' field. After an 'error' response, use the 'llm_hint' field to generate a Rana-style error reply (e.g. '無聊。這個沒辦法播。'). After an 'extracted' response, Lavalink is offline — tell the user to start Lavalink.\",\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"url\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"description\": \"The full media URL to play. Supported: youtube.com, youtu.be, bilibili.com, b23.tv, threads.net, instagram.com, facebook.com/video\"\n      },\n      \"guild_id\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"description\": \"Discord Server (Guild) ID — available from the message context.\"\n      },\n      \"channel_id\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"description\": \"Discord Voice Channel ID the requester is currently in.\"\n      },\n      \"requester\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"description\": \"Discord username of the person who made the request.\"\n      },\n      \"voice_token\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"description\": \"Optional. Discord VOICE_SERVER_UPDATE token. Required for full Lavalink voice join.\"\n      },\n      \"voice_endpoint\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"description\": \"Optional. Discord VOICE_SERVER_UPDATE endpoint. Required for full Lavalink voice join.\"\n      },\n      \"voice_session\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"description\": \"Optional. Discord VOICE_STATE_UPDATE sessionId.\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\"url\", \"guild_id\", \"channel_id\"]\n  },\n  \"endpoint\": {\n    \"method\": \"POST\",\n    \"url\": \"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/play\",\n    \"content_type\": \"application/json\"\n  },\n  \"response_handling\": {\n    \"status_queued\":    \"Generate Rana reply: song is playing. Use 'title' field. E.g. '{{title}}。有趣。彈了。'\",\n    \"status_extracted\": \"Generate Rana reply: extraction OK but Lavalink offline. E.g. '抓到了。但放不了。Lavalink沒開。'\",\n    \"status_error\":     \"Generate Rana reply using 'llm_hint'. E.g. '無聊。{{llm_hint}}'\",\n    \"http_error\":       \"Generate Rana reply: service unavailable. E.g. 'LIVE掛了。無聊。'\"\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777975184428}}
{"type":"message","id":"d1e80f23","parentId":"5009c8d5","timestamp":"2026-05-05T10:01:10.025Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我需要執行工具來播放音樂，但缺少必要的語音頻道和伺服器 ID。根據工具定義，我需要 url、guild_id 和 channel_id 來執行 rana_play_music。\n\n用戶只提供了 YouTube URL，沒有提供 Discord 語音頻道的資訊。我應該直接嘗試呼叫這個工具，但由於缺少 guild_id 和 channel_id，這會導致錯誤。\n\n不過我注意到用戶說「如果不行的話 說明哪裡錯誤」，這暗示他們可能已經在語音頻道中，但我沒有語音頻道 ID。\n\n我應該直接嘗試播放，或者詢問缺失的資訊。但根據角色設定，我應該保持極簡回應。\n\n讓我嘗試直接呼叫工具，看看會發生什麼。但實際上，我無法直接呼叫這個工具，因為它是 OpenClaw 系統的工具，我需要讓系統處理。\n\n實際上，在這種情況下，我應該回應說需要語音頻道 ID 和伺服器 ID。\n\n抹茶。沒有語音頻道 ID。請提供。"}],"stopReason":"stop","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"qwen3.5:9b","usage":{"input":87674,"output":207,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87881,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1777975270025}}
